items.toString:
{{elytron-domain}} of {{messaging-activemq}} is incorrectly updated even though it's set correctly (in {{standalone-full-ha.xml}}). It's
{noformat}
<security elytron-domain="ApplicationRealm-securitydomain"/>
{noformat}
({{ApplicationRealm-securitydomain}} not defined in the configuration) but originally it was
{noformat}
<security elytron-domain="ApplicationDomain"/>
{noformat}
with {{ApplicationDomain}} defined in the original (and migrated) configuration.
